{"id": "De-7oJwRIh9", "title": "Video by visionmachina", "description": "Baby Shine ☀️\n\nWhen Elliot sent us this track, it felt like summer in a bottle: long, slow days that turn into warm nights, and that itch to just pack a bag and disappear somewhere for a while. \n\nHe wanted the video to feel like that escape. The kind of summer that’s always just out of reach.\n\nWe love working with artists from all over the world and finding a visual language for what their music already makes you feel. This one was a lot of fun to make. Turn it up and go somewhere 🌊\n\nDirected by @luke.visionmachina\nMusic by @jaehooonchoi", "channel": "visionmachina", "uploader_id": "71483437226", "uploader": "VISION MACHINA", "timestamp": 1793073444, "like_count": 872, "comment_count": 24, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1127587239921736a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 77.392, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOcQoc_bGKaZARDRu3B9Ij60kaGQAYegL2QXBZm6snY7pmqXqaOhvZ34hYhuE4W8INNMSi8B6sqvApqEsI8B7J6HXoxKvxn_q6uasE.mp4?_nc_cat=103&_nc_oc=AdrcGPbvGdOEytm9HZ2cgydL6vlOUPx56lYy5cAC7GdIMZY_-Qqrb6_ON5g0rAxc5R0iqpDn2cWdS4XIWMQn9WDl&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=7jKGlvu04YIQ7kNvwFAxIJR&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=Zh77StBBglAHWyXrZsbUYg&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQ4X9y-jZdx_HRf3e-jeoVbuJaFGjC1RGuRb28jkJHWRA&oe=6AF43788", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 77.392, "resolution": "audio only", "ht